# API Services

See `docs/agents/api-services.md` for full conventions.

- All HTTP via `ApiClientService` — no new axios instances
- One `Api*Service` per backend resource area
- Include `tenantId` in paths where the backend expects it
- Use `apiErrorMessage.js` for user-facing error mapping
- Check backend API docs for endpoint shapes before adding calls
